    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Oates Breheny Group are delighted to present this beautifully renovated three-bedroom, three-bathroom terraced home in the popular residential development of Lissadell Park, Oxfield Road, Carney, Co. Sligo. Extensively renovated and finished to an impressive standard throughout, this stylish turnkey home offers contemporary décor and thoughtfully designed living spaces. Upon entering, you are welcomed by a bright entrance hall leading to the beautifully presented living room, featuring tiled flooring, a generous bay window and feature fireplace with solid fuel stove. An open archway leads through to the kitchen/dining area, with tiled flooring continuing seamlessly throughout. The contemporary fitted kitchen features integrated appliances, a Belfast sink and kitchen island, while the dining area benefits from attractive built-in seating and double doors opening onto the rear garden. A separate utility room, plumbed for both a washing machine and tumble dryer, provides additional convenience. Upstairs, the property offers three bedrooms, two of which are double rooms. One benefits from its own en suite, while both double bedrooms feature French doors opening onto a balcony. The third bedroom is currently utilised as a dedicated closet/dressing room, offering excellent versatility. A stylish family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation. Externally, the rear has been meticulously finished with an attractive patio area, garden shed and convenient rear access. Situated in Carney Village, this home enjoys a highly convenient location with a local shop, café, pub, Local Link bus stop and a range of sporting and recreational amenities close by. The beautiful Lissadell Beach is just a five-minute drive away, while Grange Village is approximately seven minutes by car and Sligo Town Centre just 12 minutes away. Beautifully renovated and ideally located, this impressive turnkey home offers an excellent opportunity in a sought-after village setting. To arrange a viewing, contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nLiving Room (5.10m x 3.49m) \r\nTiled flooring. Feature fireplace with solid fuel stove. Bay window. \r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining (5.40m x 4.02m)\r\nTiled flooring and splashback. Fully fitted kitchen with Belfast sink and integrated appliances. Kitchen island. Built in seating to dining area.\r\n\r\nWC & Utility Room (1.86m x 1.70m) \r\nTiled flooring. WC and WHB. Plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer. \r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.77m x 2.88m) \r\nDouble room. French doors to balcony. Access to bedroom 3/ closet room. \r\n\r\nEn Suite (1.70m x 1.55m)\r\nTiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Pump shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.10m x 2.79m) \r\nDouble room. Laminate flooring. Full length built in wardrobe. French doors to balcony. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (3.13m x 2.44m) \r\nMosaic tiling to floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.34m x 2.04m)\r\nFully tiled. Mosaic tiling to floor. Electric shower over bathtub."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Dual heating– both oil fired central heating & back boiler.\r\nPVC Double glazed windows.\r\nStira to attic.\r\nPaved rear garden with garden shed. \r\nParking to rear of the property.\r\nSituated in the village of Carney, offering a shop, café, pub and local link bus stop, with sports & recreational amenities just a short walk. \r\nSligo town is just a 12 minute drive while grange village is just 7 minutes drive.\r\nThe picturesque Lissadel beach is less than a 5 minute drive."
      },
